        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Boneco de Barro. Baltoy se movimenta girando sobre seu único pé. Alguns indivíduos já foram vistos rodopiando sobre a cabeça. Encontrado em ruínas antigas, ele gira constantemente enquanto se locomove e permanece apoiado em um pé até quando dorme.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Mineral &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Baltoy pode evoluir para Claydol no nível 12 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Confusion, Harden</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Rapid Spin</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Mud-Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Heal Block</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Rock Tomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Ancient Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Cosmic Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Power Trick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Self-Destruct</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Extrasensory</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Guard Split, Power Split</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Earth Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Sandstorm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Explosion, Imprison</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Ally Switch, Bulldoze, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Confide, Dazzling Gleam, Dig, Double Team, Dream Eater, Drill Run, Earth Power, Earthquake, Eerie Impulse, Expanding Force, Explosion, Facade, Frustration, Grass Knot, Gravity, Guard Swap, Gyro Ball, Hex, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Imprison, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Recycle, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Polish, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Sand Tomb, Sandstorm, Scorching Sands, Self-Destruct, Shadow Ball, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Solar Beam, Stealth Rock, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Telekinesis, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Wonder Room, Zen Headbutt</p>",
